refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
stringwordwrap stringstring intwidth75 stringbreak"\n" boolcut_long_words&false;
string break character प्रयोग गरी एउटा string लाई दिइएको characters को सङ्ख्यामा wrap गर्छ। cut_long_words लाई &true; मा set नगरिएसम्म Strings space (U+0020) character पछि wrap हुन्छन्।

&reftitle.changelog;





    &Version;
    &Description;





    8.0.0
    यदि break खाली string हो भने, एउटा ValueError throw गरिन्छ; पहिले यस अवस्थामा यसले E_WARNING emit गर्थ्यो र &false; return गर्थ्यो।

  &reftitle.examples;



    wordwrap को उदाहरण


<?php
$text = "The quick brown fox jumped over the lazy dog.";
$newtext = wordwrap($text, 20, "<br />\n");

echo $newtext;
?>


    &example.outputs;


The quick brown fox<br />
jumped over the lazy<br />
dog.




    wordwrap को उदाहरण


<?php
$text = "A very long woooooooooooord.";
$newtext = wordwrap($text, 8, "\n", true);

echo "$newtext\n";
?>


    &example.outputs;


A very
long
wooooooo
ooooord.




    wordwrap को उदाहरण


<?php
$text = "A very long woooooooooooooooooord. and something";
$newtext = wordwrap($text, 8, "\n", false);

echo "$newtext\n";
?>


    &example.outputs;


A very
long
woooooooooooooooooord.
and
something
